# Full-Stack Web + Software Development Starter Project

A starter template for building modern **full-stack applications**.  
Includes a clean structure for **frontend (HTML, CSS, JavaScript)** and **backend (Python + Node.js)** development.

This repository is designed for new or growing projects and works well for both **web development** and **software development** workflows.

---

## 🚀 Features

- ✔ Frontend folder with HTML, CSS, JS  
- ✔ Backend folder with Python and Node templates  
- ✔ Organized project structure  
- ✔ Ready for expansion into web apps, APIs, software tools  
- ✔ Works with GitHub, GitHub Actions, VS Code, and all dev environments  
- ✔ Beginner-friendly and scalable

